    {
      "id": "release-clamps",
      "name": {
        "en": "Release clamps",
        "zh": "释放夹"
      },
      "group": "drop",
      "summary": {
        "en": "Let go of two objects at the same moment.",
        "zh": "让两个物体在同一时刻放开。"
      },
      "detail": {
        "en": "Two clamps on one arm that open together, so neither object gets a head start [S1]. The arm slides up and down the rod to the chosen height. Letting go together, from the same height, keeps the comparison fair.",
        "zh": "同一根横臂上的两只夹子，一起张开，谁也不会先走一步 [S1]。横臂可以沿立杆上下移到选定的高度。同一高度、同时放手，比较才公平。"
