      "id": "shoe-soles",
      "name": {
        "en": "Shoe soles",
        "zh": "鞋底样品"
      },
      "group": "everyday",
      "summary": {
        "en": "A smooth sole and a grooved rubber sole.",
        "zh": "一只光滑的鞋底和一只带花纹的橡胶鞋底。"
      },
      "detail": {
        "en": "A smooth leather sole and a rubber sole with deep grooves, both laid upside down [S1]. Grooves and soft rubber help a sole grip the floor.\n\nThe kind of floor matters too: shoes grip a dry wooden floor many times better than ice [S4].",
        "zh": "一只光滑的皮鞋底和一只带深纹的橡胶鞋底，都底朝上放着 [S1]。花纹和柔软的橡胶让鞋底抓得住地面。\n\n地面也有关系：鞋子在干燥木地板上抓得比在冰上牢好几倍 [S4]。"
      },
